+Qualification and build: `Makefile.am`, `test/Makefile.am`, `tests/dsd/test_p16.c` (new), `tests/dsd/test_p16.py` (new), `tests/dsd/bench_p16.py` (new), `tests/dsd/test_dff_writer.c`, `tests/dsd/run.py`, `tests/dsd/measure.py`, `tests/dsd/bench.py`. The P16 make target inherits the P00–P14 tests, adds its physical reader and exact-FIR unit cases through the shared phase runner, and adds the real CLI integration suite. P15's closed source-bound release gate is **not** silently re-certified against changed P16 sources.
